Because the figurine, when used, gives you a pet Archon, one of the
most fearsome monsters.  The Archon always comes with a shield of
reflection, and a pet will drop items.

This has three problems I can see.

When I met Archons under normal circumstances, they blinded me from a
distance, because of their brilliance.  I don't know if a pet would
cause the same problem.

A shield from a pet won't be a blessed rustproof +3 shield.

If your pet goes wild (trapdoors can do this easily), you'll be stuck
with a dangerous opponent later.

